{
  "method": "known authored text / first-to-last VAD speech inside original cue; includes natural internal phrasing pauses; not forced word alignment",
  "sample_count": 119,
  "median_cps": 7.575757575757595,
  "p25_cps": 6.9962686567164,
  "p75_cps": 8.561643835616444,
  "future_draft_cps": 7.5,
  "final_timing_basis": "actual supplied audio",
  "samples": [
    {
      "text": "丧尸爆发后，我住进了整座山姆。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.76,
      "cps": 7.386363636363637
    },
    {
      "text": "昨天，我还在这里搬货。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.3120000000000003,
      "cps": 6.859756097560974
    },
    {
      "text": "今天，货架上的东西，我随便拿。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.016,
      "cps": 5.9523809523809526
    },
    {
      "text": "事情得从昨晚说起。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.1840000000000002,
      "cps": 6.756756756756756
    },
    {
      "text": "闭店后，同事们突然往外跑。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5999999999999996,
      "cps": 6.875000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "我追到监控前，看见停车场里有人扑倒了店长。",
      "characters": 19,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.4319999999999986,
      "cps": 7.812500000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "我立刻关下卸货区的卷帘门。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5039999999999996,
      "cps": 7.978723404255321
    },
    {
      "text": "在监控室里，躲了一夜。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.3759999999999977,
      "cps": 6.540697674418616
    },
    {
      "text": "天亮，外面还在砸门。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.3120000000000012,
      "cps": 6.097560975609751
    },
    {
      "text": "我身后却是整排饮用水、成箱罐头。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9199999999999982,
      "cps": 7.291666666666674
    },
    {
      "text": "冷库还在运转。",
      "characters": 6,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.7360000000000007,
      "cps": 8.152173913043471
    },
    {
      "text": "以前舍不得买的牛肉干和坚果，我装了满满一车。",
      "characters": 20,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.3359999999999985,
      "cps": 8.561643835616444
    },
    {
      "text": "刚坐下，卸货门外就多了一个人。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.8880000000000052,
      "cps": 6.885593220338964
    },
    {
      "text": "我放大画面。",
      "characters": 5,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.6720000000000041,
      "cps": 7.4404761904761445
    },
    {
      "text": "我刚想开门，忽然看见他一直捂着胳膊。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9840000000000018,
      "cps": 8.064516129032251
    },
    {
      "text": "我隔着对讲机，让他把袖子卷起来。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.631999999999998,
      "cps": 8.57843137254903
    },
    {
      "text": "他没有动。",
      "characters": 4,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.5120000000000005,
      "cps": 7.812499999999993
    },
    {
      "text": "他说只是摔了一跤，还让我别忘了谁给我发工资。",
      "characters": 20,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.240000000000002,
      "cps": 8.92857142857142
    },
    {
      "text": "可他一抬手，袖口滑下去了。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5360000000000014,
      "cps": 7.161458333333327
    },
    {
      "text": "小臂上，清清楚楚一圈牙印。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.7280000000000015,
      "cps": 6.365740740740735
    },
    {
      "text": "我把手从按钮上拿开。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9600000000000009,
      "cps": 9.374999999999991
    },
    {
      "text": "我先扣死了门内的插销。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9919999999999973,
      "cps": 10.08064516129035
    },
    {
      "text": "钥匙能打开外锁，却抽不开里面这道闩。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.112000000000002,
      "cps": 7.575757575757569
    },
    {
      "text": "他骂了我很久。",
      "characters": 6,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.6080000000000041,
      "cps": 9.868421052631513
    },
    {
      "text": "我坐在监控前，始终没碰开门键。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.887999999999991,
      "cps": 6.8855932203390156
    },
    {
      "text": "那一刻，我后背全是冷汗。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5679999999999978,
      "cps": 6.3775510204081725
    },
    {
      "text": "刚才只要再快一点，我就把他放进来了。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.8559999999999945,
      "cps": 8.62068965517244
    },
    {
      "text": "下午，店长不在门口了。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.2800000000000011,
      "cps": 7.031249999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "我才敢推着车去盘点物资。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.407999999999987,
      "cps": 7.812500000000072
    },
    {
      "text": "整家山姆一天清不完，我先记监控室附近的两排货架。",
      "characters": 22,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.911999999999992,
      "cps": 7.554945054945076
    },
    {
      "text": "泡面八箱，肉干六箱，坚果四箱。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.176000000000002,
      "cps": 5.514705882352937
    },
    {
      "text": "后面的货架，还一眼望不到头。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5360000000000014,
      "cps": 7.812499999999993
    },
    {
      "text": "我以前只知道搬货累，现在看什么都亲切。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.112000000000009,
      "cps": 8.04924242424239
    },
    {
      "text": "我又找了床、被子、手电和电池。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1119999999999948,
      "cps": 5.681818181818196
    },
    {
      "text": "最贵的牛排还在冷库，面包却快到期了。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1119999999999948,
      "cps": 7.575757575757595
    },
    {
      "text": "我把本子上的价格划掉，改成了保质期。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.0559999999999974,
      "cps": 15.15151515151519
    },
    {
      "text": "卸货区那辆白色面包车，车门开了。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9200000000000017,
      "cps": 7.29166666666666
    },
    {
      "text": "一个女人举着空水瓶，朝摄像头招手。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1440000000000055,
      "cps": 6.9962686567164
    },
    {
      "text": "那辆车，昨晚就停在那里。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.4080000000000013,
      "cps": 7.102272727272721
    },
    {
      "text": "我没有开门，让她先站远一点。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.4080000000000013,
      "cps": 8.522727272727264
    },
    {
      "text": "她叫许棠，是来修冷库的。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.3440000000000083,
      "cps": 7.4404761904761445
    },
    {
      "text": "昨晚取工具时外面出了事，她躲回维修车，没敢下来。",
      "characters": 21,
      "speech_phrase_span": 3.13600000000001,
      "cps": 6.696428571428551
    },
    {
      "text": "她举起的工单，和店里的记录对得上。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.759999999999991,
      "cps": 8.522727272727316
    },
    {
      "text": "我正想问她有没有受伤，冷库先报警了。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9840000000000089,
      "cps": 8.064516129032222
    },
    {
      "text": "她听见动静，让我看装卸区的外机。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.015999999999991,
      "cps": 6.944444444444475
    },
    {
      "text": "散热口前，倒着一堆纸箱。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5999999999999943,
      "cps": 6.250000000000022
    },
    {
      "text": "她放下工具包，先把纸箱挪开了。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.695999999999998,
      "cps": 7.665094339622651
    },
    {
      "text": "我照着她的说明，看温控屏上的变化。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.8240000000000123,
      "cps": 8.22368421052626
    },
    {
      "text": "十几分钟后，报警灯才熄了。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.568000000000012,
      "cps": 7.0153061224489255
    },
    {
      "text": "她确实懂这套设备。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.0879999999999939,
      "cps": 7.35294117647063
    },
    {
      "text": "可我还是没有立刻打开卖场的门。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.1200000000000045,
      "cps": 12.499999999999948
    },
    {
      "text": "她看见我犹豫，指了指两道门之间的收货间。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.048000000000002,
      "cps": 8.789062499999993
    },
    {
      "text": "她说，先让她待在那里，水和吃的放进去就行。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.5279999999999916,
      "cps": 7.120253164556986
    },
    {
      "text": "等我愿意相信她，再开里面那道门。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.632000000000005,
      "cps": 8.578431372548993
    },
    {
      "text": "她连床都没要。",
      "characters": 6,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.7680000000000007,
      "cps": 7.812499999999993
    },
    {
      "text": "我把水、面包、被子和便携厕所放进收货间。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.848000000000013,
      "cps": 5.969101123595478
    },
    {
      "text": "关好内门，才让她从外面进来。",
      "characters": 12,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5679999999999836,
      "cps": 7.653061224489876
    },
    {
      "text": "她主动留在那里观察。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.8640000000000043,
      "cps": 10.416666666666615
    },
    {
      "text": "我们之间，隔着一道带玻璃的门。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.343999999999994,
      "cps": 9.67261904761909
    },
    {
      "text": "晚上，我把盘好的物资清单贴给她看。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9840000000000089,
      "cps": 7.560483870967708
    },
    {
      "text": "她看完，把纸巾、垃圾袋和备用照明补了上去。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.6240000000000236,
      "cps": 6.859756097560914
    },
    {
      "text": "我惦记着能吃什么。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.8319999999999936,
      "cps": 9.61538461538469
    },
    {
      "text": "她惦记着，吃完以后怎么过日子。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5679999999999836,
      "cps": 8.290816326530699
    },
    {
      "text": "我熟悉货架，她熟悉设备。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5039999999999907,
      "cps": 6.648936170212807
    },
    {
      "text": "我把安全区和通道标给她，她给我圈出了冷库和备用电的位置。",
      "characters": 26,
      "speech_phrase_span": 3.1680000000000064,
      "cps": 8.20707070707069
    },
    {
      "text": "整整一夜，我们都没怎么睡。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.632000000000005,
      "cps": 6.740196078431352
    },
    {
      "text": "那道门，却谁也没催着打开。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5999999999999943,
      "cps": 6.875000000000025
    },
    {
      "text": "天亮时，我在椅子上睡醒了。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5039999999999907,
      "cps": 7.313829787234088
    },
    {
      "text": "隔着玻璃，她也靠着墙睡着了，工具包还抱在怀里。",
      "characters": 20,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.9439999999999884,
      "cps": 6.793478260869592
    },
    {
      "text": "我轻轻敲了一下窗。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9279999999999973,
      "cps": 8.62068965517244
    },
    {
      "text": "她睁开眼，我忽然觉得，今天没那么难熬了。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.4000000000000057,
      "cps": 7.083333333333316
    },
    {
      "text": "第二天傍晚，她在收货间待满了一天。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9519999999999982,
      "cps": 7.684426229508204
    },
    {
      "text": "没有发现咬伤，精神也一直清醒。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.7920000000000016,
      "cps": 7.254464285714279
    },
    {
      "text": "我们再次核对完昨晚的经过，我打开了内门。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.048000000000002,
      "cps": 8.789062499999993
    },
    {
      "text": "她进来后，先把空水瓶放进了回收袋。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1440000000000055,
      "cps": 6.9962686567164
    },
    {
      "text": "我挑了两块快到期的牛排，又洗了一大碗草莓。",
      "characters": 19,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1440000000000055,
      "cps": 8.86194029850744
    },
    {
      "text": "她看着锅，问我会不会煎。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.4720000000000084,
      "cps": 6.793478260869526
    },
    {
      "text": "我说，包装上写着。",
      "characters": 7,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.0880000000000223,
      "cps": 6.433823529411633
    },
    {
      "text": "她接过夹子，把快糊的那块翻了个面。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9199999999999875,
      "cps": 7.812500000000051
    },
    {
      "text": "这是出事后，我第一次和人坐着吃饭。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.6640000000000157,
      "cps": 9.014423076922991
    },
    {
      "text": "她问我，明天想做什么。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.2480000000000189,
      "cps": 7.211538461538352
    },
    {
      "text": "我说，把旁边的休息室收拾出来，再把剩下的货架清一遍。",
      "characters": 23,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.8479999999999848,
      "cps": 8.075842696629257
    },
    {
      "text": "她点点头，说设备归她。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.47199999999998,
      "cps": 6.114130434782692
    },
    {
      "text": "吃完，我把监控室的备用钥匙放在她碗边。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.2399999999999807,
      "cps": 7.58928571428578
    },
    {
      "text": "她没急着拿，先看了我一眼。",
      "characters": 11,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.4399999999999977,
      "cps": 7.638888888888901
    },
    {
      "text": "我说，今晚我值前半夜，后半夜换你。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1440000000000055,
      "cps": 6.52985074626864
    },
    {
      "text": "她这才收起钥匙，把最后一块牛角包分给了我。",
      "characters": 19,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.2719999999999914,
      "cps": 8.36267605633806
    },
    {
      "text": "第三天，我负责盘货、搬东西，许棠负责查设备。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 3.136000000000024,
      "cps": 5.739795918367303
    },
    {
      "text": "监控室旁边的休息室，被我们收拾了出来。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9519999999999982,
      "cps": 8.709016393442631
    },
    {
      "text": "她有了自己的床。",
      "characters": 7,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.8000000000000114,
      "cps": 8.749999999999876
    },
    {
      "text": "我的被子，也终于不用总铺在椅子上。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.9840000000000373,
      "cps": 7.5604838709676
    },
    {
      "text": "水和清洁用品分开，常温粮和临期食品分开。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.5600000000000023,
      "cps": 7.031249999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "吃剩的包装及时收走，通道一直留空。",
      "characters": 15,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.112000000000023,
      "cps": 7.102272727272649
    },
    {
      "text": "我们还清出了备用电的设备间。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.3120000000000118,
      "cps": 9.908536585365765
    },
    {
      "text": "油箱里有油，但能撑多久，得看我们怎么用。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.3360000000000127,
      "cps": 7.277397260273933
    },
    {
      "text": "每天晚上，我们先定第二天吃什么，再定第二天做什么。",
      "characters": 22,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.656000000000006,
      "cps": 8.283132530120463
    },
    {
      "text": "她喝热牛奶不放糖。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.7040000000000077,
      "cps": 11.363636363636239
    },
    {
      "text": "我总想多拿一袋肉干。",
      "characters": 9,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9599999999999795,
      "cps": 9.3750000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "她不拦我，只让我吃完记得在清单上减掉。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.920000000000016,
      "cps": 8.854166666666593
    },
    {
      "text": "半夜交班，她把温好的牛奶放在了桌上。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.5680000000000405,
      "cps": 10.204081632652798
    },
    {
      "text": "我第一次放心地关上休息室的门。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.2799999999999727,
      "cps": 10.937500000000233
    },
    {
      "text": "外面仍然有丧尸。",
      "characters": 7,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.05600000000004,
      "cps": 6.6287878787876275
    },
    {
      "text": "可我睡着的时候，终于有人替我看着那扇门了。",
      "characters": 19,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.3039999999999736,
      "cps": 8.246527777777873
    },
    {
      "text": "第四天晚上，整座山姆突然黑了。",
      "characters": 13,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.8240000000000123,
      "cps": 7.1271929824560925
    },
    {
      "text": "我第一反应是冷库。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9280000000000541,
      "cps": 8.620689655171912
    },
    {
      "text": "许棠已经戴上头灯，先让我别开冷库门。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1440000000000055,
      "cps": 7.46268656716416
    },
    {
      "text": "窗外，整条街的灯也灭了。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.4080000000000155,
      "cps": 7.102272727272649
    },
    {
      "text": "我们按事先列好的清单，保留监控、通信和一间冷库。",
      "characters": 21,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.975999999999999,
      "cps": 7.056451612903228
    },
    {
      "text": "备用发电机启动了。",
      "characters": 8,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9280000000000541,
      "cps": 8.620689655171912
    },
    {
      "text": "灯重新亮起来时，我刚松了一口气。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.8879999999999768,
      "cps": 7.415254237288226
    },
    {
      "text": "许棠却让我去看停车场。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.9600000000000364,
      "cps": 10.416666666666272
    },
    {
      "text": "刚才还散着的人影，正往设备间这边走。",
      "characters": 16,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.079999999999984,
      "cps": 7.692307692307751
    },
    {
      "text": "城市安静下来以后，机器的声音传得格外远。",
      "characters": 18,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.3360000000000127,
      "cps": 7.705479452054752
    },
    {
      "text": "我们有吃的，有水，也有油。",
      "characters": 10,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.599999999999966,
      "cps": 6.250000000000133
    },
    {
      "text": "可每用一会儿电，门外就多几张脸。",
      "characters": 14,
      "speech_phrase_span": 1.7280000000000086,
      "cps": 8.101851851851812
    },
    {
      "text": "我把用电清单摊在桌上，许棠把冷库记录放到旁边。",
      "characters": 21,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.8799999999999955,
      "cps": 7.2916666666666785
    },
    {
      "text": "我们得重新安排机器的运行，既省油，也少暴露自己。",
      "characters": 21,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.8479999999999563,
      "cps": 7.37359550561809
    },
    {
      "text": "我抬头看监控。",
      "characters": 6,
      "speech_phrase_span": 0.6080000000000041,
      "cps": 9.868421052631513
    },
    {
      "text": "停车场最远处，又有一片人影转向了我们。",
      "characters": 17,
      "speech_phrase_span": 2.1759999999999877,
      "cps": 7.812500000000044
    }
  ]
}
